# Gaming Database Management System
# Overview
   -This project is a SQL-based Gaming Database Management System.
   -It manages data related to players, games, scores, and platforms.
   -It demonstrates core DBMS concepts like relationships and normalization.

# Features
   -Store and manage game details 
   -Maintain player information
   -Track scores across games
   -Use SQL JOINs for analysis
   -Ensure data integrity with keys
# Tech Stack
   -MySQL
   -SQL
   -MySQL Workbench
